{"blocks":[{"type":"paragraph","text":"個別握手会in横浜"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"成人式。\n着物着てる人たくさん見ました。\n鮮やかできれいだったなー"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/marika.ito/img/blog/marika.ito/img/2013/01/15/7706095/0000.gif","alt":""},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"まいやん、さゆりん、ななみ、みさ"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"お姉たまたち♪\nおめでとうございます。"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"でも大変な日だったね！\n雪！大雪だった！"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"なんでこんなに日っっっ"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/marika.ito/img/blog/marika.ito/img/2013/01/15/7706095/0001.gif","alt":""},{"type":"paragraph","text":"‼"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"私は3部からだったのですが...\n雪のため15分遅れて握手会に\nさせていただきました...><"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"ご迷惑おかけしました; ;"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"3部 ストレート耳掛け"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/marika.ito/img/blog/marika.ito/img/2013/01/15/7706095/0002.jpeg","alt":""},{"type":"paragraph","text":"シャツ 45rpm\nカーディガン Casper\nパンツ 韓国\nブーツ Dr.Marten"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"シャツのボタンは苦しくなければ\n上まで止める派です。\nもっと男っぽくしようと思ったけど\nヒール履きよったで"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/marika.ito/img/blog/marika.ito/img/2013/01/15/7706095/0003.gif","alt":""},{"type":"paragraph","text":"盛りましたで"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/marika.ito/img/blog/marika.ito/img/2013/01/15/7706095/0003.gif","alt":""},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"若月がイケメンすぎて\n直視できなかった...\nひめかと火花がばちばち←"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"4部5部 編み込みまとめ\nやっぱり好評だった♪"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/marika.ito/img/blog/marika.ito/img/2013/01/15/7706095/0004.jpeg","alt":""},{"type":"paragraph","text":"トップス H＆M\nチュチュ WEGO\nティペット pas de calais"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"ガラッと変わって超女の子らしく"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/marika.ito/img/blog/marika.ito/img/2013/01/15/7706095/0005.gif","alt":""},{"type":"paragraph","text":"メンバーに\nぶりっちょん(ぶりっ子してる)\nてめっちゃ言われた笑\nぶりぶり"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/marika.ito/img/blog/marika.ito/img/2013/01/15/7706095/0006.gif","alt":""},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"握手会で初めてぶれた服装したなあ。"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"こんな天候の中、\n来てくださった方\n本当にありがとうございました。"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"風邪引かないようにね><"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"雪降ったらはしゃぐなんて\n子ども子ども"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/marika.ito/img/blog/marika.ito/img/2013/01/15/7706095/0007.gif","alt":""},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"私ははしゃいでないぞ"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/marika.ito/img/blog/marika.ito/img/2013/01/15/7706095/0007.gif","alt":""},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"早く雪溶けろおおおおお"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/marika.ito/img/blog/marika.ito/img/2013/01/15/7706095/0008.jpeg","alt":""},{"type":"paragraph","text":"今日はありがとうございました！\nだいすき！"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"まりか"}],"source":"archive"}